# Protections for the M-1b ingress corpus. Held IDENTICAL across every target
# in this corpus on purpose: the ingress mechanism is the only variable, so a
# protection difference would confound the measurement.
#
# canary=OFF  the overwrite must reach the gate at offset 64
# pie=OFF     keeps the technique's address handling out of the comparison
# -O0         the struct layout that pins the gate to offset 64 is an -O0
#             layout; at higher -O the member can be reordered or elided and
#             the target silently stops being solvable by the sweep
-fno-stack-protector
-no-pie
-O0
